# Content IS under version control since the GitHub publication: without it a
# fresh clone has no level, HUD, cell meshes or MetaSound and will not run.
# The old caveat still applies to .uasset/.umap churn: binary diffs cannot be
# reviewed or merged, and a level saved right after a GenerateRandom() stress
# run balloons because ISM components serialize their runtime instances into
# the .umap. Before committing Content, sanity-check `git status` sizes and
# don't save levels mid-simulation.
#
# Personal per-developer sandbox folders stay out.
Content/Developers/
Content/Collections/